  "title": "Conjunctions",
  "description": "And, but, or, because, that, if, when… and where the comma goes.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "Polish puts a comma before most conjunctions that start a clause (a, ale, bo, że, żeby, ponieważ, który), but not before a single i, oraz, lub or albo.",
      "table": {
        "columns": ["Polish", "English", "Example", "In English"],
        "rows": [
          ["i", "and", "Kawa i herbata.", "Coffee and tea."],
          [
            "a",
            "and, whereas",
            "Ja piję kawę, a on herbatę.",
            "I drink coffee, and he drinks tea."
          ],
          ["ale", "but", "Chcę iść, ale nie mam czasu.", "I want to go, but I don't have time."],
          ["albo, lub", "or", "Dzisiaj albo jutro.", "Today or tomorrow."],
          ["czy", "or (in questions)", "Kawa czy herbata?", "Coffee or tea?"],
          [
            "bo",
            "because (informal)",
            "Zostaję w domu, bo pada.",
            "I'm staying at home because it's raining."
          ],
          [
            "ponieważ",
            "because",
            "Nie przyszedł, ponieważ był chory.",
            "He didn't come because he was ill."
          ],
          ["że", "that", "Myślę, że masz rację.", "I think you're right."],
          [
            "żeby",
            "so that, in order to",
            "Uczę się, żeby zdać egzamin.",
            "I'm studying to pass the exam."
          ],
          [
            "jeśli, jeżeli",
            "if",
            "Jeśli chcesz, pójdziemy razem.",
            "If you like, we'll go together."
          ],
          [
            "kiedy, gdy",
            "when",
            "Kiedy byłem mały, mieszkałem na wsi.",
            "When I was little, I lived in the country."
          ],
          [
            "chociaż",
            "although",
            "Chociaż jest zimno, idę na spacer.",
            "Although it's cold, I'm going for a walk."
          ],
          ["więc", "so", "Jestem zmęczony, więc idę spać.", "I'm tired, so I'm going to bed."],
          [
            "dlatego",
            "that is why",
            "Pada, dlatego zostaję w domu.",
            "It's raining, so I'm staying at home."
          ],
          ["zanim", "before", "Zadzwoń, zanim przyjdziesz.", "Call before you come."]
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
